# All-player owner corner markers

Replace custom-item ownership dots with coloured corner triangles shown only in the All-player Analysis view.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] A custom Analysis row has no owner marker while one player colour is selected.
- [ ] All-player mode shows an owner marker for every saved production check and plan.
- [ ] The marker is a triangle filled with the owning player's colour.
- [ ] The triangle fills the upper-right corner of the row's fixed left-hand cell.
- [ ] The marker is positioned slightly left/up relative to the former dot while remaining inside the cell bounds.
- [ ] The marker does not alter row height, name/icon alignment, expansion, or fixed/value-pane synchronization.
- [ ] The marker has an accessible ownership label that does not duplicate the row action.
- [ ] Switching between a player and All updates markers immediately without changing stored ownership.
- [ ] UI regression coverage compiles.
- [ ] Focused rendering checks pass on a functioning simulator or device.
